  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6626c84bb700413428bce8fec5aff79d, type: 3}
  m_Name: SocialTips
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  _description: 'wouldn''t hurt to give her some advice. poor thing needs it.


    the
    player offers a helping hand to jessi, saying that she can guide her towards
    living her life out as she''s meant to. jessi thinks this is a little odd, but
    really has nothing better to do right now (other than go home, but the player
    has already taken that opportunity from her.)


    the player first tells jessi
    that she needs to stop trying to act all high and mighty. no one likes someone
    who''s all in over their head; you have to realize how much you actually matter
    and act accordingly.


    jessi doesn''t really see how she''s acting all "high
    and mighty," she''s just reacting to the stupid world around her.


    silly
    jessi. the only reason it seems "stupid" to her is because she''s simply not
    GETTING what it''s trying to tell her. the interactions she''s having are going
    south because she wants them to be enjoyable for her, but it''s just not meant
    to be enjoyable at all. you gotta work with what you got, whether you like it
    or not.


    so what is she supposed to do? well, once she gets rid of that
    unwarranted ego, she should just listen to whatever other people tell her to
    do. they probably would know better than her anyway (jessi is a little offended
    at this and asks what that''s suposed to mean, but the player doesn''t elaborate.
    that''s for later.)


    she''s already done good with choosing a position that
    lets her take orders, it''s good reinforcement for what she should be doing.
    now she just needs to apply that to real life.


'
